{
    "title": "Bibino Baby Monitor - Baby Cam",
    "description": "Bibino - a must have <b>baby monitor app</b> for all parents! With the Bibino baby monitor app, you can use your old phone as a baby camera and have a piece in mind. Turn 2 devices into a single video nanny cam and monitor your child from anywhere! \r\n\r\n<b>Baby cam that parents LOVE!</b>\r\n\r\nMonitor your baby in HD video, hear every sound from the child\u2019s room and detect motion. Our baby cam is all what modern parents need. Using our baby cam as a babysitter app, you can monitor your baby when you are not at home or traveling. See how much fun your child has with a babysitter or get a notification if the kid is awake. \r\n\r\n<b>Bibino - baby monitor features:</b>\r\n\r\n\u25cf BABY CAMERA - turn two devices into a single video baby cam\r\n\u25cf LIVE HD VIDEO - watch your baby from anywhere\r\n\u25cf ACTIVITY LOG - record events your baby makes\r\n\u25cf MOTION DETECTION - check if your baby is calm\r\n\u25cf UNLIMITED REACH - baby cam with Wi-Fi and LTE, 3G\r\n\u25cf LULLABIES - lull your baby to sleep with 20+ lullabies\r\n\u25cf SOOTHE YOUR BABY - remotely with your voice\r\n\u25cf NOTIFICATIONS - stay notified about your babies\r\n\u25cf CONNECT - with multiple parent & baby devices\r\n\u25cf NIGHT LIGHT - peaceful monitoring during the night\r\n\u25cf NANNY APP - perfect babysitting app for your pocket\r\n\r\nUnlock Bibino baby camera full potential with Premium! Start a FREE trial and see why our baby cam is loved by parents.\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY PARENTS LOVE BIBINO BABY MONITOR?</h2>\r\n\ud83d\udc40 \ud83e\uddbb <b>Hear & watch your baby</b>\r\nUse our baby cam live HD video and audio monitoring, to watch and hear your baby remotely. Monitor what is happening in the baby's room. Are you looking for a remote babysitter app? Bibino is here to help.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 <b>Unlimited reach</b>\r\nWith Bibino nanny cam, parents are not limited by distance. Our baby monitoring 3G app works over any Wi-Fi and mobile data (LTE, 3G), which makes Bibino baby cam perfect when traveling as each device can be connected to a different network.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>Easy set up</b>\r\nNo need to buy expensive baby cam devices. All you need are two devices - cell phones, tablets, or computers, and Wi-Fi or LTE, 3G. Place one device in the child\u2019s room to monitor your baby and keep the second device with you.\r\n\r\n\u2708\ufe0f <b>Traveling with the baby</b>\r\nBibino is a must-have app for any parents when traveling. Bibino baby video monitor is always one tap away, and with Wi-Fi, LTE, 3G, Our baby camera app works where other baby monitors fail.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddbb <b>Enhance audio with Every Noise</b>\r\nWhen you're not sure what the sound you just heard was, Bibino app can temporarily sensitize the audio so you can hear everything clearly.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3 <b>Soothe your baby remotely</b>\r\nWhen your baby starts to wake up, you can soothe your child back to sleep remotely with Bibino nany app.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfbc <b>Play your little one a lullaby</b>\r\nChoose from a variety of lullabies and soothing sounds (white noise, household sounds\u2026) to lull your baby to sleep.\r\n\r\n\u23f0 <b>History from past monitorings</b>\r\nBibino, a baby camera app, records noises, videos, or photos from each monitoring. You can also replay recorded files and share the Activity Log with another family member or a doctor to discuss your baby\u2019s sleeping patterns and activity.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Monitor with multiple devices</b>\r\nWith Bibino baby monitor and baby surveillance app, you can monitor your baby from multiple devices. Bibino also supports monitoring multiple babies (up to 4) simultaneously from one Parent Station. For clarity, you can create a child avatar and name.\r\n\r\n\u267b\ufe0f <b>Upcycle your older phone or tablet</b>\r\nNo need to purchase expensive hardware baby monitors, CCTV or IP baby camera when you can recycle old devices as your baby cam.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 <b>Stay notified</b>\r\nBibino, the baby monitor app notifies you through visuals and sound when your baby is awake. Get alerts in case of any issues.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa5 <b>No hardware cameras or baby monitors</b>\r\nWith Bibino nanny cam, you have everything you need. Have the best baby monitor app at hand and take care of your child from anywhere!\r\n\r\nBibino baby cam contact: support@tappytaps.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bibino - a must have <b>baby monitor app</b> for all parents! With the Bibino baby monitor app, you can use your old phone as a baby camera and have a piece in mind. Turn 2 devices into a single video nanny cam and monitor your child from anywhere! <br><br><b>Baby cam that parents LOVE!</b><br><br>Monitor your baby in HD video, hear every sound from the child\u2019s room and detect motion. Our baby cam is all what modern parents need. Using our baby cam as a babysitter app, you can monitor your baby when you are not at home or traveling. See how much fun your child has with a babysitter or get a notification if the kid is awake. <br><br><b>Bibino - baby monitor features:</b><br><br>\u25cf BABY CAMERA - turn two devices into a single video baby cam<br>\u25cf LIVE HD VIDEO - watch your baby from anywhere<br>\u25cf ACTIVITY LOG - record events your baby makes<br>\u25cf MOTION DETECTION - check if your baby is calm<br>\u25cf UNLIMITED REACH - baby cam with Wi-Fi and LTE, 3G<br>\u25cf LULLABIES - lull your baby to sleep with 20+ lullabies<br>\u25cf SOOTHE YOUR BABY - remotely with your voice<br>\u25cf NOTIFICATIONS - stay notified about your babies<br>\u25cf CONNECT - with multiple parent &amp; baby devices<br>\u25cf NIGHT LIGHT - peaceful monitoring during the night<br>\u25cf NANNY APP - perfect babysitting app for your pocket<br><br>Unlock Bibino baby camera full potential with Premium! Start a FREE trial and see why our baby cam is loved by parents.<br><br><h2>WHY PARENTS LOVE BIBINO BABY MONITOR?</h2><br>\ud83d\udc40 \ud83e\uddbb <b>Hear &amp; watch your baby</b><br>Use our baby cam live HD video and audio monitoring, to watch and hear your baby remotely. Monitor what is happening in the baby&#39;s room. Are you looking for a remote babysitter app? Bibino is here to help.<br><br>\ud83c\udf10 <b>Unlimited reach</b><br>With Bibino nanny cam, parents are not limited by distance. Our baby monitoring 3G app works over any Wi-Fi and mobile data (LTE, 3G), which makes Bibino baby cam perfect when traveling as each device can be connected to a different network.<br><br>\u2705 <b>Easy set up</b><br>No need to buy expensive baby cam devices. All you need are two devices - cell phones, tablets, or computers, and Wi-Fi or LTE, 3G. Place one device in the child\u2019s room to monitor your baby and keep the second device with you.<br><br>\u2708\ufe0f <b>Traveling with the baby</b><br>Bibino is a must-have app for any parents when traveling. Bibino baby video monitor is always one tap away, and with Wi-Fi, LTE, 3G, Our baby camera app works where other baby monitors fail.<br><br>\ud83e\uddbb <b>Enhance audio with Every Noise</b><br>When you&#39;re not sure what the sound you just heard was, Bibino app can temporarily sensitize the audio so you can hear everything clearly.<br><br>\ud83d\udde3 <b>Soothe your baby remotely</b><br>When your baby starts to wake up, you can soothe your child back to sleep remotely with Bibino nany app.<br><br>\ud83c\udfbc <b>Play your little one a lullaby</b><br>Choose from a variety of lullabies and soothing sounds (white noise, household sounds\u2026) to lull your baby to sleep.<br><br>\u23f0 <b>History from past monitorings</b><br>Bibino, a baby camera app, records noises, videos, or photos from each monitoring. You can also replay recorded files and share the Activity Log with another family member or a doctor to discuss your baby\u2019s sleeping patterns and activity.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Monitor with multiple devices</b><br>With Bibino baby monitor and baby surveillance app, you can monitor your baby from multiple devices. Bibino also supports monitoring multiple babies (up to 4) simultaneously from one Parent Station. For clarity, you can create a child avatar and name.<br><br>\u267b\ufe0f <b>Upcycle your older phone or tablet</b><br>No need to purchase expensive hardware baby monitors, CCTV or IP baby camera when you can recycle old devices as your baby cam.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <b>Stay notified</b><br>Bibino, the baby monitor app notifies you through visuals and sound when your baby is awake. Get alerts in case of any issues.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa5 <b>No hardware cameras or baby monitors</b><br>With Bibino nanny cam, you have everything you need. Have the best baby monitor app at hand and take care of your child from anywhere!<br><br>Bibino baby cam contact: support@tappytaps.com.",
